00:14:21.800 --> 00:14:28.810
Then what do you do at the top to prevent
getting deductions and carry a lot of interest

00:14:28.810 --> 00:14:30.279
carryforwards and all these things?

00:14:30.279 --> 00:14:34.149
How do you really make a billionaire pay 26%
effective?

00:14:34.149 --> 00:14:36.329
Because for most of them, that's an increase
in what they pay.

00:14:36.329 --> 00:14:39.570
Speaker 5: Well, so, so and again, we're talking
