guys don't.

00:15:15.650 --> 00:15:16.950
What do you do about that?

00:15:16.950 --> 00:15:21.070
Speaker 5: I I've always.

00:15:21.070 --> 00:15:22.550
This is such great stuff, David.

00:15:22.550 --> 00:15:23.550
Damn it.

00:15:23.550 --> 00:15:24.959
And I miss this stuff.

00:15:24.959 --> 00:15:26.630
Could do this.

00:15:26.630 --> 00:15:28.350
I'd get rid of the capital gains tax.

00:15:28.350 --> 00:15:29.470
Speaker 1: Just make it earn.

00:15:29.470 --> 00:15:30.519
Same as income.

00:15:30.519 --> 00:15:31.910
Speaker 5: Yeah, yeah.

00:15:31.910 --> 00:15:32.910
Don't.

00:15:32.910 --> 00:15:33.910
